{
    "chapter_num": 21,
    "verses_count": 15,
    "paragraphs_list": [
        {
            "type": "section_header",
            "text": "David and the Holy Bread"
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 1,
                    "num_str": "1",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Now David came to Nob, to Ahimelech the priest. And Ahimelech was afraid when he met David, and said to him, “Why "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "are"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " you alone, and no one is with you?”"
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 2,
                    "num_str": "2",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "So David said to Ahimelech the priest, “The king has ordered me on some business, and said to me, ‘Do not let anyone know anything about the business on which I send you, or what I have commanded you.’ And I have directed "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "my"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " young men to such and such a place. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 3,
                    "num_str": "3",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Now therefore, what have you on hand? Give "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "me"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " five "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "loaves of"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " bread in my hand, or whatever can be found.”"
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 4,
                    "num_str": "4",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "And the priest answered David and said, “"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "There is"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " no "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "FOOTNOTE",
                            "text": "ordinary"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "common bread on hand; but there is holy"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "FOOTNOTE",
                            "text": "consecrated"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " bread, if the young men have at least kept themselves from women.”"
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 5,
                    "num_str": "5",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Then David answered the priest, and said to him, “Truly, women "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "have been"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " kept from us about three days since I came out. And "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "FOOTNOTE",
                            "text": "The young men are ceremonially undefiled"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "the vessels of the young men are holy, and "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "the bread is"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " in effect common, even though it was consecrated in the vessel this day.”"
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 6,
                    "num_str": "6",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "So the priest gave him holy "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "bread;"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " for there was no bread there but the showbread which had been taken from before the "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "DIVINE_NAME",
                            "text": "Lord"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": ", in order to put hot bread "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "in its place"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " on the day when it was taken away."
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 7,
                    "num_str": "7",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Now a certain man of the servants of Saul "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "was"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " there that day, detained before the "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "DIVINE_NAME",
                            "text": "Lord"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": ". And his name "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "was"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " Doeg, an Edomite, the chief of the herdsmen who "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "belonged"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " to Saul."
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 8,
                    "num_str": "8",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "And David said to Ahimelech, “Is there not here on hand a spear or a sword? For I have brought neither my sword nor my weapons with me, because the king’s business required haste.”"
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 9,
                    "num_str": "9",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "So the priest said, “The sword of Goliath the Philistine, whom you killed in the Valley of Elah, there it is, wrapped in a cloth behind the ephod. If you will take that, take "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "it."
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " For "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "there is"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " no other except that one here.”"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "LINE_BREAK",
                            "text": "\n"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "And David said, “"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "There is"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " none like it; give it to me.”"
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "section_header",
            "text": "David Flees to Gath"
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 10,
                    "num_str": "10",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Then David arose and fled that day from before Saul, and went to Achish the king of Gath. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 11,
                    "num_str": "11",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "And the servants of Achish said to him, “"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "Is"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " this not David the king of the land? Did they not sing of him to one another in dances, saying:"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "LINE_BREAK",
                            "text": "\n"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "‘Saul has slain his thousands,"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "LINE_BREAK",
                            "text": "\n"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "And David his ten thousands’?”"
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 12,
                    "num_str": "12",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Now David took these words "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "FOOTNOTE",
                            "text": "Lit. in his heart"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "to heart, and was very much afraid of Achish the king of Gath. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 13,
                    "num_str": "13",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "So he changed his behavior before them, pretended "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "FOOTNOTE",
                            "text": "insanity"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "madness in their hands, "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "FOOTNOTE",
                            "text": "scribbled"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "scratched on the doors of the gate, and let his saliva fall down on his beard. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 14,
                    "num_str": "14",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Then Achish said to his servants, “Look, you see the man is insane. Why have you brought him to me? "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 15,
                    "num_str": "15",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Have I need of madmen, that you have brought this "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "fellow"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " to play the madman in my presence? Shall this "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "fellow"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " come into my house?”"
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        }
    ]
}